  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cmRWhN4.png\" alt=\"YUNG&#x27;s Bridges\" width=\"1344\" height=\"416\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsapibadge\" alt=\"需要 YUNG&#x27;s API\" width=\"211\" height=\"26\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/rns3beq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsdiscordbadge2\" alt=\"加入 Discord 上的 YUNG GANG！\" width=\"136\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungstwitterbadge3\" alt=\"在 Twitter 上關注我！\" width=\"76\" height=\"27\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmEhjcMNhSDTRJgjVfbs9Rw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsyoutubebadge\" alt=\"訂閱我的 YouTube 頻道！\" width=\"80\" height=\"30\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://patreon.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungspatreonbadge\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我！\" width=\"138\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ug8dC9A.png\" alt=\"這是什麼？\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p>\n<p>YUNG's Bridges 是首款為遊戲添加自然生成橋樑的 Minecraft 模組。探索世界，發現超過 15 種不同類型的橋樑，每種都擁有對應生態域的變體！</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4aMS_7aq3ws?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ladFuIF.png\" alt=\"相容性\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p>\n<p>YUNG's Bridges 旨在與所有世界生成模組完全相容，包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-mineshafts-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Mineshafts</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-strongholds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Strongholds</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-dungeons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Dungeons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-extras\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Extras</a></li>\n<li>Oh the Biomes You'll Go</li>\n<li>Biomes O' Plenty</li>\n<li>TerraForged：會使河流變得較小且河岸陡峭。橋樑仍可能生成，但建議嘗試調高生成率。</li>\n<li>Upstream：會使河流變得極大——事實上大多數橋樑無法在此生成。請嘗試調高生成率，尤其是大型橋樑。通常情況下，只有當河中央出現類似島嶼的地形時，你才會看到橋樑生成。</li>\n<li>Terralith：會使河流擁有更陡的河岸。&nbsp;橋樑仍可能生成，但建議嘗試調高生成率。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252fx%252fyung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2mVOWMC.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1230\" height=\"241\"></a></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a49IMQJ.png\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fyung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nQRs7ZP.png\" alt=\"使用優惠碼 YUNGNICKYOUNG 於 Bisect Hosting 享 25% 折扣！\" width=\"1344\" height=\"400\"></a></p>",
